---
description: "Route engineering work through Compound Skills"
alwaysApply: true
---

For reviews, read the diff once, trace callers and verify tests cover changed lifecycle paths. Report findings promptly. Ask before probing. If denied, use source only. For bugs, confirm the regression fails as expected before editing. For refactors, establish a passing baseline and preserve caller behavior. Check changed arguments at receivers, including omitted and falsy inputs. Run the final full suite once and review the scoped diff. Load `compound` for unfamiliar conventions, broad changes, performance, PRs, ChatGPT/Codex UI work, or explicitly requested screenshot checks. Use `map` for unverified Python citations. Follow project instructions and omit AI commit credits.
